# Collaboration Guidelines: Cursor AI & Antigravity AI

Both Cursor AI and Antigravity AI are working together on this repository (Ishva AI).

1. Always read AI_TASK_BOARD.md and AI_COMMUNICATION.md before making changes.
2. Avoid duplicating files or features already created by Antigravity AI.
3. Update AI_TASK_BOARD.md with your active tasks and mark them completed when done.
4. Leave handoff messages in AI_COMMUNICATION.md under [Cursor -> Antigravity].
5. Git: `git fetch` / `git pull --rebase` before commits. Never force-push, never `reset --hard`, never amend commits you did not just create. Prefix commits with `feat(cursor):` or `fix(cursor):`.
